WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.565
Hi there! Who are you?

2
00:00:09.566 --> 00:00:13.466
I'm a gray wolf.

3
00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:18.260
Wolves are a kind of wild dog.

4
00:00:18.261 --> 00:00:23.313
We're bigger than most pet dogs.

5
00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:26.090
Where do you live?

6
00:00:26.091 --> 00:00:30.008
I live in the United States.

7
00:00:30.009 --> 00:00:34.535
Wolves live in other parts of the world too.

8
00:00:34.536 --> 00:00:40.119
We live in forests and tundra, and on prairies.

9
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.470
Are you dangerous?

10
00:00:43.471 --> 00:00:47.636
Lots of people think we're dangerous.

11
00:00:47.637 --> 00:00:51.798
But we almost never hurt people.

12
00:00:51.799 --> 00:00:54.776
What do you eat?

13
00:00:54.777 --> 00:00:59.896
Sometimes we eat small animals like hares.

14
00:00:59.897 --> 00:01:04.876
We also hunt bison and moose.

15
00:01:04.877 --> 00:01:09.796
Whoa! Bison and moose are big animals!

16
00:01:09.797 --> 00:01:14.753
Yes, but wolves live in packs.

17
00:01:14.754 --> 00:01:19.225
We all work together to hunt big prey.

18
00:01:19.226 --> 00:01:22.981
How do wolves learn to hunt?

19
00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:26.999
Cubs learn by playing.

20
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.768
They pretend to fight each other.

21
00:01:30.769 --> 00:01:38.108
And they chase small animals.

22
00:01:38.109 --> 00:01:41.228
What's that sound?

23
00:01:41.229 --> 00:01:44.698
That's our pack leader.

24
00:01:44.699 --> 00:01:50.691
He howls to keep our pack together.

25
00:01:50.692 --> 00:01:54.675
I've got to join my pack now.

26
00:01:54.676 --> 00:01:57.656
Good-bye!

27
00:01:57.657 --> 00:02:05.127
Good-bye, Gray Wolf!

